            </li>
            <li>Substituting Ohm's law into that sum: V/R<sub>total</sub> = V/R1 + V/R2.</li>
            <li>Dividing both sides by V: <strong>1/R<sub>total</sub> = 1/R1 + 1/R2</strong>.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
